    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "an intentional break? i feel like i've tried every break. vacations, therapy, sleeping more... nothing touches it. it's more than just being tired. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop of nothingness and there's no way to actually make it stop. everything is just so heavy and hollow.",
